backup.body:
This is the backup email you set up in Security Notes. The backup file is attached, in the full format of this app (ZIP).

Backup time: {time}
Backup size: {size}
Entries: {entries}
Attachments: {attachments}
Encryption: {encryption}

This message does not contain any entry content. An encrypted backup can only be opened with its passphrase, and a forgotten passphrase cannot be recovered.
